'''{{PAGENAME}}''' is a cape and a [[player card]] in ''[[Helldivers 2]]''.

==Acquisition==
This [[Cosmetics#Capes and Cards|Cape and Player Card set]] can be bought from the [[Superstore#Permanent_Catalog|Permanent Catalog]] on the [[Superstore]] for {{Currency|SC|100|notext}} and 35 [[Super Credits]], respectively.

== Trivia ==
* This cape and player card set, along with the [[DP-8 Mountain-Scaled]] set of armor, was most likely introduced to commemorate the Chinese New Year of 2026 which is the Year of the Horse.

